### Explored Factors

#### Volatility-Scaled Five-Day Reversal

The candidate fades each instrument’s trailing five-session return, normalizes the signal by 20-session realized volatility, cross-sectionally demeans by the daily median, and clips outliers to `[-6, 6]`:

\[
F_t =
